OL,3,GNEWSARoadside blood transfusion saved
OL,4,Ahit-and-run victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victim of a hit-and-run crash said
OL,7,Fhe would have died of his injuries if
OL,8,Fan air ambulance team had not given him
OL,9,Fa blood transfusion.
OL,11,FCorey Russell, 22, was walking home in
OL,12,FSpennymoor, County Durham, after a
OL,13,Fnight out when he was struck by a
OL,14,Fvehicle in September 2023.
OL,16,FA Great North Air Ambulance Service
OL,17,F(GNAAS) doctor carried out a blood
OL,18,Ftransfusion at the scene, something not
OL,19,Froutinely offered by road ambulance
OL,20,Fteams.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39902
