OL,3,GNEWSARoadside blood transfusion saved
OL,4,Ahit-and-run victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell said he was raising awareness
OL,7,Fof the charity-run service, ahead of a
OL,8,Fdozen landmarks across the North East
OL,9,Fand Cumbria lighting up green every
OL,10,Fnight until Sunday to honour
OL,11,Fcharity-run air ambulance services.
